From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jonax1337 <jonas.laux@hotmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:01:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Kindling: Pregenerator lifecycle hooks and directional
 look-ahead class

A working pregeneration keeps the server from pausing for lack of players, and the pregenerator saves its exact progress while the server stops. The directional chunk loading maths moved into net.kindlingmc.chunk.LookAheadDirection, which ignores teleports and border hovering, and the concurrent generation limit resolves through ChunkGenerationLimit.resolve.

